From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: EDEN_NX2_MESH_COMPUTE_LONE=1 runs only mesh programs without a task as compute in the core

Core patch, on the T45 series or mig020-core. Off unless the switch is set, and it needs
EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE=1 as well.

With EDEN_NX2_RADV_MESH_COMPUTE=1 the driver runs task pipelines as compute and drops every mesh
draw without a task: 25 of the 46 pipelines in run190, 16 programs. This sends those down the core's
own compute path, which has handled a mesh program alone since patch 0214, and leaves task pipelines to
the driver. Neither path then touches the NGG mesh launch.

Only worth building if a lone draw has workgroups. Every drop with a known count was empty, and the one
lone program with a real count, 9dc7, draws into a 128x68 target.

The core path has never drawn on a PS5: run156 fell back to native for want of device addresses. It
breaks the render pass for every non-empty draw, so expect it to cost fps.

Not built, not run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
diff --git a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_cache.cpp b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_cache.cpp
index f6cac16..abca279 100644
--- a/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_cache.cpp
+++ b/src/video_core/renderer_vulkan/vk_pipeline_cache.cpp
@@ -712,6 +712,17 @@ std::unordered_map<u64, u8> LoadUsedPipelines(const std::filesystem::path& path,
 // boot that ran out of memory never saved one and the next boot did the same.
 constexpr size_t MaxPipelinesWithoutUsedList = 3000;
 
+// EDEN_NX2_MESH_COMPUTE_LONE=1, with EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE=1: only mesh programs without a task
+// program run as compute here. Pipelines with a task program stay native mesh pipelines, for the
+// driver to run as compute (EDEN_NX2_RADV_MESH_COMPUTE=1), which refuses and drops the lone ones.
+bool MeshComputeLoneOnly() {
+    static const bool lone = [] {
+        const char* value = std::getenv("EDEN_NX2_MESH_COMPUTE_LONE");
+        return value != nullptr && value[0] == '1';
+    }();
+    return lone;
+}
+
 // EDEN_NX2_MESH_COMPUTE_ONLY=<hash>[,<hash>...]: with EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE=1, only task/mesh
 // pipelines whose task (or lone mesh) program or mesh program has one of these shader hashes (hex,
 // the hashes of the "Mesh pipeline ... runs as compute"/"first draw" lines and of the
@@ -1586,7 +1597,8 @@ std::unique_ptr<GraphicsPipeline> PipelineCache::CreateGraphicsPipeline(
     size_t env_index{0};
     std::array<Shader::IR::Program, Maxwell::MaxShaderProgram> programs;
     // Task and mesh programs run as compute (EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE=1, vk_mesh_compute.h).
-    const bool mesh_as_compute{mesh_scratch != nullptr && mesh_scratch->IsValid()};
+    const bool mesh_as_compute{mesh_scratch != nullptr && mesh_scratch->IsValid() &&
+                               (!MeshComputeLoneOnly() || key.unique_hashes[3] == 0)};
     const bool uses_vertex_a{key.unique_hashes[0] != 0};
     const bool uses_vertex_b{key.unique_hashes[1] != 0};
 
